  "limits": [
    "Native formula applied to existing local age and indexed random inputs; native RNG/clock producers and live FPCR remain unobserved.",
    "Nearest-even is an explicit local packet rounding policy; no native game or Metal shader execution.",
    "All ten retained quad/billboard UV0 profiles have exact half unit corners; the specialization is guarded. This does not implement arbitrary per-vertex half UV transforms for other families.",
    "The selected GPU port uses authored base textures and an independent atlas vertex expression. Atlas cases neutralize black endpoint lookup colors; midlife cases retain authored lookup textures. Tint, size and blending are normalized. No native Metal execution or complete native visual parity is claimed.",
    "Node 22-compatible tests use literal integration coordinates and skip only the optional ECMAScript conversion corpus when Math.f16round is unavailable. Node 24 executes all 45 focused cases.",
    "The existing original Leona archive closure and default-platform Lux sampler golden remain the same two full-suite failures. Existing golden values, assertions and wave deadlines are unchanged."
  ],
  "diagnostics": [
    "An initial TypeScript draft widened the lookup tuple through Array.map; final code quantizes the locally owned tuple in place.",
    "An initial test draft used an unparenthesized negative exponent expression; it was corrected before acceptance.",
    "The first browser command included a nonexistent sword-spec name, so its four primary cases ran successfully while the new packet probe failed. The second run explicitly selected both existing sword regression specs and the corrected packet probe, retaining a separate output directory.",
    "The first packet pixel probe used black birth/near-expiry LUT endpoints. Its required old-policy difference guard failed, preventing an empty-image pass. Final atlas rows use a neutral lookup and separate midlife rows retain authored LUTs; all fifteen final reference outputs are nonempty.",
    "The final 45-case focused run follows the optional-standard-conversion guard and literal lookup-coordinate integration update for Node 22 compatibility; game source was unchanged after the full suite."
  ],
